  "steps": [
    "Melt the butter in a saucepan over medium heat, add the condensed milk and coconut and stir 5–7 minutes until thick and pulling away from the pan. Chill until cool.",
    "Roll tablespoons of the mixture into balls with greased hands and set on parchment.",
    "Boil the sugar, water and vinegar, stirring now and then, until amber. Take off the heat.",
    "Dip each ball on a toothpick into the caramel and set back on the parchment to harden."
